# Phones tools/install-debug.sh expects every time.
#
# Every phone paired for wireless debugging and on the network gets the debug
# build anyway; a phone listed here is also reported when it cannot be reached,
# and the run fails. The name is used in the output.
#
# Copy to tools/debug-devices.local (not committed) and list one phone per
# line: its serial, then a name. `tools/install-debug.sh --list` shows the
# serial of every reachable phone.

SERIAL_OF_PHONE_1  Phone 1
SERIAL_OF_PHONE_2  Phone 2
